		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>A unit of drow cultists.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 16 (chain), <strong>HP</strong> 39, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 shortsword +3 (2d6 + poison), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 8</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Poison</strong>. CON 15+ or sleep.</p><p></p><p><strong>Regenerate</strong>. Cultists cast healing on themselves. Unless reduced to 0 HP, regains 2d6 HP on its turn.</p><p></p><p><strong>Sunblind</strong>. Blinded in bright light.</p><p></p><p><strong>Troop</strong>. If reduced to 20 HP or less, makes morale check and deals half damage.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
